2026-07-25 13:24:23,351 1254555 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_step_new args={'title': 'Ledger field-rename fix — restore Pending/Executed on the shipped mt-transport shape', 'description': 'mt-transport shipped a full command-ledger rewrite (commit 975449e, xsession [request-ledger]) that broke the Control page\'s Pending/Executed split, sort, and receipt/error display — confirmed live: every entry now has status:null and enqueuedAt:null (old fields gone entirely, not additive). Peter independently spotted the symptom ("now it only shows 1 line, the command") before I finished investigating; root cause confirmed via raw API before responding.\n\nPeter\'s decision: fix the field-rename NOW on the existing 5s-polling architecture (small, un-breaks production); the SSE swap (mesh.request-* on GET /v1/events, replacing polling) is a separate follow-up task, not bundled here.\n\nConfirmed field mapping (sampled real queued/done/cancelled entries live):\n  status → state (queued|trying|done|sent|failed|expired|cancelled)\n  attempts/maxAttempts → tries/maxTries\n  enqueuedAt → createdAt\n  receipt → result\n  lastError (string) → error ({code,message} object) — mt-transport\'s explicit correction: a queued entry can still carry a stale error from a PREVIOUS try, so "is this actually broken" must key on state===\'failed\'||\'expired\', never on presence of error. This generalizes my earlier "first miss ≠ failure" fix rather than replacing it.\n  New: kind (\'command\'|\'text\') — the ledger now also holds text messages, not just commands.\n\nScope:\n- src/pac-host.js: _pollQueues() computes `since` from `createdAt` (was `enqueuedAt`).\n- public/app-control.js: controlLedger() sorts by `createdAt`. controlPending() = state in (queued,trying). controlExecuted() = everything else. Filter the Control page\'s ledger to kind===\'command\' only — the existing tab-control.md Invariant already says command traffic must never render alongside chat, and the ledger now conflates both; filtering here keeps that invariant intact rather than silently violating it. Text-message display (any future Chat sub-tab use of kind:\'text\' entries) is out of scope, a separate task.\n- public/partials/tab-control.html: badge class map keyed on new state names (done→success, sent→info advisedly NOT success since mt-transport flagged unconfirmed-delivery as needing a visually distinct treatment — full design deferred, but avoiding the false "confirmed" implication is not deferrable; failed/expired→error; cancelled→warning; queued/trying→info), error display gated on state===\'failed\'||\'expired\' (not mere presence of entry.error) showing error.message, receipt grid reads entry.result instead of entry.receipt.\n\nVerify: live against the real pac-host service (already showing the new shape), both themes, Pending/Executed populate again, newest-first sort restored, a real failed/expired entry (if any exist) shows its error, a done entry shows its result grid.'}
