2026-07-26 11:40:41,299 64308 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_project_set args={'name': 'services', 'description': "**The Node side.** One PM2 service, `pac-host` on `:8787`: the request ledger,\nwake-window delivery, reply correlation, and a domain API. The only thing in the project that\nknows mesh mechanics — consumers speak devices, commands and alerts.\n\nTalks to mesh-gw `:8001` and nothing else; node-dash consumes `../docs/api/http.md` from us.\nOffline-testable, no hardware needed, 19 suites. The boundary is FLASH vs NO-FLASH: nothing\nhere needs a cable.\n\nThe device is deaf ~99% of the time and Meshtastic gives a message ~31 s of life, so this\nservice's cross-window retry is the entire delivery guarantee."}
