2026-07-26 13:21:21,937 64308 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'goal', 'text': 'Standing ledger of every defect found in services/, verified or not. Append, never delete.\n\nA finding stated only in conversation is not reported — conversation is discarded and the next session starts blind. This is where "report, do not fix" actually lands, per the /idiot skill\'s out-of-scope rule.\n\nEach entry carries: a stable id (B1, B2, …), a status (CONFIRMED / UNVERIFIED / NOT OURS), file:line, and the evidence — a measurement, an output, a quoted line. What is not yet known is stated plainly rather than left as a hunch.\n\nAn entry leaves this ledger only when it is FIXED or DISPROVED WITH EVIDENCE. "Probably fine", "pre-existing" and "not related to this change" are not disposals. If a finding turns out worse than first recorded, raise its severity here explicitly — under-rating a live defect once it has been seen is the failure this ledger exists to prevent.'}
