2026-07-27 14:25:03,080 175346 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'name': 'rx-window-configurable', 'kind': 'plan', 'text': 'g_rxWindowMs replaces the constant at the window site; PersistedSettings gains rxWindowMs with a v10->v11 migration that freezes PersistedSettingsV10 and honours roleIdx; CONFIG_FIELDS rx.win in seconds bounded 3-60; applySet wiring; a `window [secs]` verb shaped like `interval` whose bare form reports; win reported in status and config. 3 s floor is a safety interlock — below it the unit cannot be commanded back. Verify by command, by status, and by LC rxopen/SLEEPNOW in the sleep cycle.'}
