2026-07-27 20:57:02,045 242420 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'name': 'bugs', 'kind': 'note', 'text': 'B1 UNVERIFIED — Re-entrancy in command dispatch during blocking moves. file: src/main_mqtt.cpp:43 / src/main.cpp:335. During move2az(), yieldFn() calls amqtt.loop() which can trigger onCmd() with a new command. No guard prevents a second move2az() from being called while the first is in progress. The hold feature partially mitigates this (once holdUntil is set, subsequent commands are rejected) but there is a window between when move2az() starts and when holdUntil is written. Seen during: move2az-hold investigation.'}
