2026-07-28 09:21:55,873 242420 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'name': 'bugs', 'kind': 'note', 'text': 'B1 CONFIRMED — Hold cannot be cancelled via WS while active\nfile: src/main.cpp:303\nThe wsCmd hold gate blocks ALL commands when motor.isHeld() is true, including a `hold 0` that would clear holdUntil. There is no way to release an active hold via WebSocket (or MQTT — same gate in onCmd). Only way out is waiting for the hold to expire.\nEvidence: hold gate code at line 303 returns early for every action when isHeld(); no explicit release path exists.\nUnknown: whether a hold 0 via serial console bypasses this (console.call goes direct, not through wsCmd).\nFound during: dash-hold-indicator task, 2026-07-28.'}
