an open window. Downgraded today: the logs show 8.5-9.5 s leads,\n       which is correct pre-emption. Its cause was removed by 6e47034 anyway.\n\nNOT OURS\n  B11  dev/CLAUDE.md wrongly lists trial-logger as a separate service.\n  B19  config-schema default path pointed at the abandoned tree (superseded by the generated file).\n\nWHY THIS EXISTS: two mis-ratings in one day, both mine. B49 as "small housekeeping" cost a night\'s\nexperiment and produced a false report that we had switched antennas. B67 as an aside left the\ndeployed unit unconfigurable. In a list of 50 entries with no severity, the reader has to re-derive\nthe stakes of each one — so the stakes get re-derived wrongly, or not at all.'}
