own)\nis covered by the code path returning false, NOT by an assertion; worth adding.\n\nNOT MEASURED, deliberately: whether this improves command success. GARG\'s direct path has\nbeen gone since 07:17 (B68) and 0 of 28 sends landed today (B69), so any rate now describes\nthe link. One change per measurement.'}
