2026-07-29 09:30:20,206 27975 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'plan', 'text': 'One file, one insertion. `public/partials/tab-node.html`, the `value_grid` branch.\n\n**Before** (`:154-159`) — a single flex row, label left, value right, no third slot:\n\n```html\n<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 border-b border-base-200 py-1">\n  <span class="text-xs text-base-content/50" x-text="f.label"></span>\n  <span class="text-sm font-mono tabular-nums" x-text="f.text"></span>\n</div>\n```\n\n**After** — the pair becomes the first line of a two-line row; `desc` sits under it, right-aligned so it reads as belonging to the value and not the label:\n\n```html\n<div class="border-b border-base-200 py-1">\n  <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3">\n    <span class="text-xs text-base-content/50" x-text="f.label"></span>\n    <span class="text-sm font-mono tabular-nums" x-text="f.text"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div x-show="f.desc" class="text-xs text-base-content/50 text-right" x-text="f.desc"></div>\n</div>\n```\n\nMirrors the header stat card at `:78`, which already renders `f.desc`. Same DaisyUI semantic classes, no px sizes, no inline styles (STYLE_GUIDE §2/§4).\n\n## Not changed, and why\n\n- `src/node-status.js` — Domain 1. It supplies `desc`; it does not render it. Emitting a `value_grid` section is `node-page-reachability`\'s work.\n- `docs/NODE_STATUS_RPC_SPEC.md`, `docs/modules/node-status.md` — both document `value_grid` as `{fields:[{label,raw,text,ts}]}`. `desc` is already an optional key on `field()` (`src/node-status.js:38-41`) and already used by `hopsField`/Signal, so the payload contract is unchanged. Those docs describe the server side and are Domain 1\'s to amend if needed.\n- The four other modified files in `public/` — pre-existing uncommitted `traceroute-header-button` work (task 788). Untouched.\n\n## Verification\n\nRegression only, and stated as such. Real proof of the positive case is deferred to `node-page-reachability` because no live `value_grid` section exists yet — see the Phase 4 note in `docs/modules/tab-node.md`. An injected fixture would prove the template and not the wiring, so it was not used.\n\n## Exit — BLOCKED BY ANOTHER TASK, not by this one\n\n`python scripts/check_specs.py` reports **2 stale: `app-ws`, `browser-playwright-audit`.** Both pre-date this change; proven by stashing this task\'s two files and re-running, which produced the identical two failures. `tab-node` reports `ok`, and `browser-playwright-audit` does not list `tab-node.html` among its 30 sources.\n\nCause: task 788 `traceroute-header-button` has `public/app-ws.js`, `public/app.js` and `public/index.html` modified and uncommitted, and its specs unhashed. **No task in this repo can show a clean `check_specs` until 788 closes.**\n\nCommitted at `9f6e7fa`.'}
