2026-07-29 10:55:27,072 27975 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'goal', 'text': "Every header stat card shows its **whole** `desc`, not an ellipsis.\n\nMeasured 2026-07-29 at 1600×1000, `.stat-desc` computed style is `white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis` in a 171 px box:\n\n| desc | needs | clipped |\n|---|---|---|\n| `10:37` | 171 | no |\n| `OMNI · 434 of 464 direct` | 171 | no |\n| `traceroute 14 Jul 17:51 · 886 failed since` | **228** | **yes** |\n| `Poor · -9.0 dB · best of 2 · YAGI · direct 24m ago` | **275** | **yes** |\n\nTwo of three qualifiers are cut off — and the qualifier is the entire point of `signal-ssot-header` (`cc2e55f`). `886 failed since` is precisely the part that says a value is frozen, and it is the part being hidden.\n\nIntroduced by `cc2e55f`, which lengthened the desc strings. Domain 2, split out under CLAUDE.md's rule that no fix may span domains.\n\nPresentation only: no data change, no new field, the server already sends the full string.\n\nSpec: `docs/SIGNAL_SSOT_SPEC.md` §5 — which predicted this might be needed and said to split it out if so."}
