2026-07-29 20:40:05,741 53368 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'name': 'ltc-bugs', 'text': 'L4 UNVERIFIED — user report: some projects\' history shows all-zero measurements or nothing at all (projects: default, lipo-2200, rak4631-sensor, rak-6531-senso, rak-cam-uart-f). Active project bare-rak verified healthy 2026-07-29 (2 records, full stats). Candidate buckets: sub-quantum runs (ltc-hist-integrity improves display), pre-NTP t collisions (L1), or genuinely new. NOT KNOWN: per-project record contents — audit blocked by L2 + live test; verify after test ends via project_select + ltcctl history per project. L5 NOT OURS — mcpp plan tools resolve task names globally across projects: notes_set(name="bugs") from ltc4150 wrote into another project\'s ledger and the goal-kind upsert OVERWROTE that ledger\'s goal note (id:1041) irrecoverably from this side; misplaced B1 note (id:1691) was deleted after verification. Evidence: tool echoes 2026-07-29 ~19:38, saved in session tool-results. Affects spm/mcpp server — report upstream.'}
2026-07-29 20:40:17,960 53368 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_new args={'name': 'ltc-avg-span', 'title': 'Pulse-span average estimator — kills the est/full-life sawtooth', 'steps': ['Amend SPEC-STATS.md (estimator change, exact diffs), attach', 'Implement battery.h + main.cpp (persist span, p_span status field) + drawer, build-verify (NO FLASH)', 'DEFERRED on-device observation: sawtooth gone across a pulse boundary (device off-bench)']}
2026-07-29 20:40:26,339 53368 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'goal', 'text': 'SERIOUS user-reported bug, live-confirmed 2026-07-29: full_h/est_h sawtooth — avgMa() = usedMah_/runMs_ (battery.h:222-225) divides counted charge by elapsed time INCLUDING the un-counted in-flight quantum, so avg dilutes between pulses ((N+1)/N error, 2x at N=1; measured: avg 0.75→0.71 creeping then snap to 1.39 at pulse 2, exactly q/T for the observed T≈446 s). Fix: pulse-span estimator — avg = (N−1)·quanta / (t_lastDisPulse − t_firstDisPulse) for N≥2 (exact for steady loads, flat between pulses, immune to LTC4150 integrator start-offset); N<2 falls back to the old formula (±100% declared by life_err anyway). Convergence estimator deliberately untouched (ledger L3).'}
