2026-07-30 22:21:11,109 1041 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'plan', 'text': "Canonicalise BOTH sides of the comparison in images.progress(), rather than at write time — canonicalising e.node would change the payload store path as a side effect, and that is a separate change with its own measurement.\n\nindex.js: _unitKeySync(target) using resolveTarget on the cached roster + _knownIds (no I/O, no await — progress() must answer while a pull blocks, B98). Injected into images as resolveKey.\nimages.js: this.resolveKey defaults to identity, so an uninjected Images keeps today's behaviour; progress() compares resolved keys and each row gains `unit` beside the verbatim `node`.\n\nSHIPPED e7e8492. before (pid 17602): ?336b -> 1, ?!8cee336b -> [], ?8cee336b -> []. after (pid 50108): all three find it, unit !8cee336b, rising 2/12 17%."}
