2026-07-30 22:21:41,687 1041 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'plan', 'text': "store.js: listImages()/loadImage() — the missing read half of save(). Scans EVERY node dir (save() keys the subdir on the caller's raw string, so one unit has files under both '336b' and '!8cee336b'); filename regex anchored to exactly what save() writes so the .part/.stats.json sidecars are ignored.\nimages.js: store-first get() with opts.refresh to force the radio; stored() for the list. Matching by canonical key (resolveKey from B106), so the directory split is survived without moving files.\nhost-module.js: GET /images/:target/stored, registered ABOVE /images/:target/:pid (first-wins matcher, else 'stored' parses as a pid); :pid gains ?refresh=1.\n\nSHIPPED 160a4a1. cached 0.0033 s vs 183-239 s by radio; sha256 17150dcc..6203de79 identical on both copies; list 5 = find 5; suites 30/1.\n\nACCEPTED: pid is uint16 and recycles, so a cached pid is not guaranteed to be what the device holds now. ?refresh=1 is the escape hatch. Deliberate trade, recorded in the spec."}
